    {
      "id": "Zgl6y59rt0F90IMLNrfFN",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 67.16887213686744,
      "y": 905.4212030372062,
      "width": 1015,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "av",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 127529272,
      "version": 449,
      "versionNonce": 604785992,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783743663350,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. In General terms Linked List is Data Structure that store data in Objects called Nodes.\n\n2. Every node contain 2 things data ( for storing values ) and next : ( for containg addresses or null).\n\n3. In this way it solves the problem of continuous memory given by Array.\n\n4. So even if memory is scattered Data can be stored .",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. In General terms Linked List is Data Structure that store data in Objects called Nodes.\n\n2. Every node contain 2 things data ( for storing values ) and next : ( for containg addresses or null).\n\n3. In this way it solves the problem of continuous memory given by Array.\n\n4. So even if memory is scattered Data can be stored .",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "IbZXFYZEBl7APhdgG2OTs",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 423.99944674565893,
      "y": 1176.2176263984854,
      "width": 297,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aw",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 339712840,
      "version": 62,
      "versionNonce": 2029081144,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783744035339,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "How Java supports LinkedList\n===========================",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "How Java supports LinkedList\n===========================",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "S845YWMYulIlmm8_0dRAY",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 242.7568140511482,
      "y": 1266.1471769720977,
      "width": 614,
      "height": 275,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "ax",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1066214472,
      "version": 378,
      "versionNonce": 1181422904,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783744202400,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. java provides us a class called LinkedList in collection family.\n\n2. It inherits 2 interfaces : List and Queue.\n\n3. It stores data in Doubly LinkedList internally.\n\nthat means it has 3 members :\n\na. data : stores value .\nb. next : stores address of next node .\nc prev : stores address of previous node .",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. java provides us a class called LinkedList in collection family.\n\n2. It inherits 2 interfaces : List and Queue.\n\n3. It stores data in Doubly LinkedList internally.\n\nthat means it has 3 members :\n\na. data : stores value .\nb. next : stores address of next node .\nc prev : stores address of previous node .",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
